  "description": "Please send email to make appointment.\n\nThis house will be available to rent from late November 2026.\n\nThis is a spacious 3 bedrooms town house in the mature and leafy location in Dublin 16.\n\nIt is a bright and spacious house with a private south facing back garden.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway, living room, kitchen, master ensuite, double bedroom, single bedroom and main bathroom.\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to move into a well-established south Dublin Suburb. Rathfarnham village which hosts an array of cafes, bars and restaurants, is a five-minute drive and Dundrum Town Centre with its abundance of high-end shopping is also ten minutes away.\n\nMarley Park is only a short stroll from your door.\n\nViewing by appointment only.",
